00:38:48.450 --> 00:38:51.590
There were seven Dundies given out at this awards.
这次颁奖典礼一共颁发了七个邓迪奖。

967
00:38:51.790 --> 00:38:54.730
I'm sure there were more given out, but what we witnessed were seven.
我肯定还有颁发其他的，但我们看到的只有七个。

968
00:38:55.010 --> 00:38:59.530
There was the busiest beaver, which was the bushiest beaver to Phyllis.
一个是“最忙碌海狸奖”，颁给了菲利斯，其实是“最浓密海狸奖”。

969
00:38:59.970 --> 00:39:02.690
There was hottest in the office to Ryan the Temp.
一个是颁给临时工瑞恩的“办公室最火辣奖”。

970
00:39:03.010 --> 00:39:03.470
Awkward.
尴尬。

971
00:39:03.850 --> 00:39:10.310
There was the tight ass award given to my character, because not only is she's everybody's favorite stickler,
还有一个是颁给我角色的“死板屁股奖”，因为她不仅是大家最爱挑刺的人，

972
00:39:10.450 --> 00:39:11.870
