而且她还有个很棒的屁股。

973
00:39:12.050 --> 00:39:14.050
The spicy curry award given to Kelly.
颁给凯莉的“辛辣咖喱奖”。

974
00:39:14.050 --> 00:39:19.410
And it was actually a bowling award, because they had run out of the little men holding briefcases.
那其实是个保龄球奖杯，因为他们用完了那种拿着公文包的小人奖杯。

975
00:39:19.410 --> 00:39:20.550
So she got a bowler.
所以她拿到了一个保龄球手。

976
00:39:21.210 --> 00:39:21.710
Yeah.
是啊。

977
00:39:22.230 --> 00:39:26.390
And then number five went to Kevin for the Don't Go In There After Me award.
第五个是颁给凯文的“我之后别进去奖”。

978
00:39:26.750 --> 00:39:28.130
Here's the interesting thing about that.
关于这个有个很有趣的事。

979
00:39:28.150 --> 00:39:33.970
If you look at that Dundee, it's actually a little guy squatting, but it was actually a weightlifting award,
如果你仔细看那个邓迪奖杯，其实是个蹲着的小人，但它原本是个举重奖杯，

980
00:39:33.970 --> 00:39:36.610
and they took the dumbbell out of the guy's hands.
他们把那人手里的哑铃给拿掉了。

981
00:39:36.690 --> 00:39:37.570
Oh, that's so smart.
哦，那太聪明了。

982
00:39:37.570 --> 00:39:39.030
So that's what Kevin gets.
所以凯文拿到的就是那个。

983
00:39:39.190 --> 00:39:42.750
And then number six is the Fine Work Award given to Stanley.
第六个是颁给斯坦利的“杰出工作奖”。

984
00:39:43.190 --> 00:39:48.130
And number seven, of course, is the Widest Sneakers Award given to Pam, which brings the house down.
第七个当然就是颁给帕姆的“最宽运动鞋奖”，这让全场都沸腾了。

985
00:39:48.270 --> 00:39:52.930
So a lot of fans asked this, specifically Courtney asked, what Dundee did Jim get?
很多粉丝问过这个问题，特别是考特尼问的，吉姆拿到了什么邓迪奖？

986
00:39:53.150 --> 00:39:55.750
This is the first Dundee ceremony, and we never see him get his award.
这是第一次邓迪奖颁奖典礼，我们从没看到他领奖。

987
00:39:56.390 --> 00:39:58.510
Jim gets the Jim Halpert Award.
吉姆拿到了“吉姆·哈珀特奖”。

988
00:39:59.230 --> 00:40:00.830
That was his Dundee.
那就是他的邓迪奖。

989
00:40:00.930 --> 00:40:01.530
You're just being Jim Halpert.
你就是做你自己，吉姆·哈珀特。

990
00:40:01.670 --> 00:40:05.090
Yeah, it got cut out, but Jim got the Jim Halpert Award.
是啊，那段被剪掉了，但吉姆确实拿到了“吉姆·哈珀特奖”。

991
00:40:05.270 --> 00:40:05.890
That's awesome.
太棒了。

992
00:40:06.030 --> 00:40:06.470
So strange.
真奇怪。

993
00:40:06.470 --> 00:40:09.010
I think Michael just thinks Jim is cool.
我觉得迈克尔只是觉得吉姆很酷。

994
00:40:09.190 --> 00:40:09.350
Yeah.
是啊。

995
00:40:09.550 --> 00:40:11.110
