00:40:24.270 --> 00:40:25.010
That is the least of my worries right now.
那是我现在最不担心的事情。

1002
00:40:25.810 --> 00:40:30.610
Well, when Greg would direct, he would often pull us aside and interview us on the fly,
嗯，格雷格执导的时候，经常会把我们拉到一边进行即兴采访，

