1091
00:43:49.930 --> 00:43:51.790
and they pulled these other two people out.
然后把另外两个人拉走了。

1092
00:43:51.990 --> 00:43:57.250
But in watching it, it's so funny to me because it's like Oscar keeps entertaining.
但看成片的时候，我觉得特别好笑，因为看起来就像奥斯卡一直在招待客人。

