Someone mentioned that.
有人提过这件事。

1145
00:45:35.070 --> 00:45:35.370
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1146
00:45:35.470 --> 00:45:36.530
And he's a big guy.
而且他是个大块头。

1147
00:45:36.670 --> 00:45:37.210
He is.
确实是。

1148
00:45:37.410 --> 00:45:40.810
So, you sort of really see in that moment that Pam is just fed up.
所以，在那一刻你真的能看出帕姆已经受够了。

1149
00:45:40.830 --> 00:45:42.010
And she wants to stay.
她想留下来。

1150
00:45:42.130 --> 00:45:43.450
And she wants to be with her friends.
她想和她的朋友们在一起。

1151
00:45:43.950 --> 00:45:46.590
And I think she wants to be with another person.
我觉得她想和别人在一起。

1152
00:45:46.910 --> 00:45:47.890
I don't know what you're talking about.
我不知道你在说什么。

1153
00:45:47.990 --> 00:45:48.150
Yeah.
是啊。

1154
00:45:48.310 --> 00:45:53.350
I think she wants to be with Jim, who she sits down at a table with.
我觉得她想和吉姆在一起，她正和他坐在桌边呢。

1155
00:45:53.570 --> 00:45:53.930
I know.
我知道。

1156
