And the look on his face when you come back in.
还有你回来时他脸上的表情。

1157
00:45:56.370 --> 00:45:56.610
Oh.
哦。

1158
00:45:56.770 --> 00:45:57.670
He is so delighted.
他真是太高兴了。

1159
