She starts drinking his beer immediately.
她立刻就开始喝他的啤酒了。

1160
00:45:59.690 --> 00:46:00.050
I know.
我知道。

1161
00:46:00.290 --> 00:46:01.710
Then she orders her own drinks.
然后她又点了自己的酒。

1162
00:46:01.710 --> 00:46:04.550
And it leads us into a famous line.
这引出了一句名台词。

1163
00:46:04.690 --> 00:46:06.150
