Yeah.
是啊。

1181
00:46:38.190 --> 00:46:38.970
What was she drinking?
她喝的是什么？

1182
00:46:39.230 --> 00:46:39.770
I don't know.
我不知道。

1183
00:46:39.770 --> 00:46:42.990
But I think they really wanted the drinks to pop so you could see them.
但我认为他们确实想让酒看起来显眼点，这样你们才能看清。

1184
00:46:43.130 --> 00:46:45.270
And so they added a lot of like food dye and things.
所以他们加了很多食用色素之类的东西。

1185
00:46:45.490 --> 00:46:48.230
Well, the beer is usually just non-alcoholic beer.
嗯，啤酒通常就是无酒精啤酒。

1186
00:46:48.370 --> 00:46:50.030
So the beer actually tastes like beer.
所以啤酒喝起来确实像啤酒。

1187
00:46:50.190 --> 00:46:51.050
And you feel bloaty.
而且你会觉得肚子胀。

1188
00:46:51.470 --> 00:46:51.730
Yeah.
是啊。

1189
00:46:51.890 --> 00:46:54.210
And I don't like beer and I don't like the taste of beer.
我不喜欢啤酒，也不喜欢啤酒的味道。

1190
00:46:54.350 --> 00:46:56.990
So I hate it whenever I have to drink it on camera because bleh.
所以我讨厌在镜头前喝它，因为太难喝了。

1191
