其实你拥有那个我反而很开心。

1203
00:47:20.690 --> 00:47:23.190
Like if you have a Long Island iced tea in it, you're just drinking an iced tea.
比如如果你往里倒了长岛冰茶，那你喝的就只是杯冰茶而已。

1204
00:47:23.330 --> 00:47:23.510
Yeah.
没错。

1205
00:47:23.510 --> 00:47:28.710
Sam just pulled up for you guys listening a whole page on the internet of just me rolling
山姆刚才给听众朋友们搜出了一整页网上关于我翻白眼

1206
00:47:28.710 --> 00:47:30.430
my eyes and looking snarky.
和一脸刻薄表情的照片。

1207
00:47:30.690 --> 00:47:35.690
So as Angela Martin, I guess there's a lot of snarky eye roll options out there are just
所以作为安吉拉·马丁，我想网上有很多我翻白眼或者

1208
00:47:35.690 --> 00:47:36.450
snarky looks.
一脸刻薄的表情供大家选择。

1209
00:47:36.690 --> 00:47:38.310
They're not limited to the Dundies.
不仅仅局限于邓迪奖颁奖礼。

1210
00:47:38.490 --> 00:47:39.710
Okay, Sam, take it down.
好了，山姆，关掉吧。

1211
00:47:39.910 --> 00:47:42.650
I can't look at myself rolling my eyes at myself.
我没法看着自己对自己翻白眼。

1212
00:47:42.810 --> 00:47:48.630
So now we get into the tender moment where Michael is desperately trying to keep the Dundies
现在我们进入了那个温情的时刻，迈克尔拼命想让邓迪奖

1213
00:47:48.630 --> 00:47:51.750
going and the guys at the bar start to heckle him.
继续进行下去，而酒吧里的那些人开始起哄嘲讽他。

1214
00:47:51.870 --> 00:47:52.170
Yeah.
是啊。

1215
00:47:52.170 --> 00:47:54.450
And he's so wounded.
他看起来真的很受伤。

1216
00:47:55.370 --> 00:47:57.310
And Pam won't have it.
而帕姆看不下去了。

1217
00:47:57.630 --> 00:47:59.130
Well, I think it's that moment.
嗯，我觉得就是那一刻。

1218
00:47:59.310 --> 00:48:05.690
Even there's a look that comes across Jim's face of like, ooh, like that's mean, you know?
吉姆脸上甚至闪过一种表情，好像在说，噢，这也太刻薄了，你知道吗？

1219
00:48:05.870 --> 00:48:06.010
Yeah.
没错。

1220
00:48:06.090 --> 00:48:10.790
And it's sort of that thing of like, you know, your creepy cousin that creeps everyone out,
这就像是那种感觉，你知道，你有个让所有人都觉得毛骨悚然的怪表亲，

1221
00:48:10.930 --> 00:48:12.950
